<h1>Hike Cerro Quemado Quetzaltenango</h1>
<p>&nbsp;The hike to Cerro Quemado, also known as Almolonga Volcano, takes approximately two hours from Central Park in Quetzaltenango, Guatemala. The summit of this extinct volcano is a rocky lava dome measuring approximately 3.3 kilometres wide and reaching an elevation of 3,197 feet above sea level.</p>
